# Union-room door: Teala in the Pokemon Centre 2F, no other DS.
#
# Script 9003 is the union-room clerk, west desk at (7, 4). 9001 next
# to her is the Colosseum. Local wireless starts only after the save
# and the walk through the door (ScrCmd_153 -> CommManager_StartUnion).
# That path needs the WM model; this station drives the door.

name UNIONR
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_2F 7 5 FACE_UP
